Seat an advocate: mount .advocate-engine and open the feasibility chair

WIP. Mounts FCCN-ANTIBODY/advocate.anecdote.channel at `.advocate-engine` and adds
`advocate.yml` with one seat, `feasibility`.

The seat: run the smallest experiment that would settle whether a thing is possible here,
before a design rests on the assumption. Scratch implementations live on the advocate's
own orphan branch, so they survive the session that wrote them.

Pairs with docs/WANTED.md (#15) — that file is the queue, this seat is what works it.

